{"duration_api_ms":185492,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6b88cae2-6d22-4a37-9bc5-b90c33ba22b3","total_cost_usd":1.5791264,"usage":{"input_tokens":58,"cache_creation_input_tokens":94176,"cache_read_input_tokens":2192632,"output_tokens":19348,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3136},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":94176,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":895,"cache_read_input_tokens":97412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2744,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2744},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":58,"outputTokens":19348,"cacheReadInputTokens":2192632,"cacheCreationInputTokens":94176,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.5791264,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":3136,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01MLh9PbNxmSK53p9vHCPcNB","tool_input":{"command":"sed -n '/^## Look and feel/,/^## [A-Z]/p;/^## Qualities/,/^## What/p' project/product.md | head -80; cat src/DcaShop.Checkout/Application/Shared/IPaymentProvider.cs; git diff src/DcaShop.Checkout/Application/Shared/IPaymentProvider.cs","description":"Read product sections and port"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_018Cwpfn17jwHkMdVWF9fwpz","tool_input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/DcaShop.Checkout/Infrastructure/CheckoutContextRegistration.cs'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n\"\"\",\"\"\"using Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    public static IServiceCollection AddCheckoutContext(this IServiceCollection services)\n    {\n\"\"\",\"\"\"    public static IServiceCollection AddCheckoutContext(this IServiceCollection services, IConfiguration configuration)\n    {\n        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(services);\n        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(configuration);\n\n\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        services.AddSingleton<IPaymentProvider, MockPaymentProvider>();\n\"\"\",\"\"\"        AddPaymentProvider(services, configuration);\n\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        return services;\n    }\n}\"\"\",\"\"\"        return services;\n    }\n\n    /// <summary>\n    /// The payment service provider when its address is configured, the stand-in otherwise — one provider either way.\n    /// </summary>\n    private static void AddPaymentProvider(IServiceCollection services, IConfiguration configuration)\n    {\n        var options = configuration.GetSection(PaymentProviderOptions.SectionName).Get<PaymentProviderOptions>();\n        if (options?.BaseUrl is not { } baseUrl)\n        {\n            services.AddSingleton<IPaymentProvider, MockPaymentProvider>();\n            return;\n        }\n\n        services.AddHttpClient(RestPaymentProvider.HttpClientName, client =>\n        {\n            // A trailing slash, so the provider's paths resolve below its address rather than replacing its last segment\n            client.BaseAddress = baseUrl.AbsoluteUri.EndsWith('/') ? baseUrl : new Uri(baseUrl.AbsoluteUri + \"/\");\n            client.Timeout = options.Timeout;\n        });\n        services.AddSingleton<IPaymentProvider, RestPaymentProvider>();\n    }\n}\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/DcaShop.Infrastructure/DcaShopRegistration.cs'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"services.AddCheckoutContext();\",\"services.AddCheckoutContext(configuration);\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -rn \"AddCheckoutContext\" src tests","description":"Update DI registration and host call"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01XJpeEUQVJ5imrUX7g8HiHa","tool_input":{"command":"export PATH=$HOME/.dotnet:$PATH && dotnet build 2>&1 | grep -E \"error|warn|Build succeeded\" | sort -u | head -30","timeout":300000,"description":"Build the solution"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01JDpBSpwHaz3N3ArcBqFK1M","tool_input":{"command":"for p in UnitTests IntegrationTests ArchitectureTests; do echo \"== $p\"; dotnet test tests/DcaShop.$p 2>&1 | grep -E \"^\\s*(Failed|Fehler|Bestanden|Passed|Total|Gesamt)|error|failed!|Passed!|Bestanden!|Fehler!\" | head -20; done","timeout":600000,"description":"Run unit, integration and architecture tests"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_018XipMSFwxVvBCvoUBKALZM","tool_input":{"command":"dotnet test tests/DcaShop.E2eTests --no-build --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~ProviderPaymentE2eTest\" 2>&1 | grep -E \"Bestanden!|Fehler!|SKIP\"; dotnet format 2>&1 | tail -3; dotnet format --verify-no-changes 2>&1 | tail -3; echo \"format rc=$?\"; git status --short","timeout":600000,"description":"Confirm happy path ran, format, list changes"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":49,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The build stage for `pay-through-the-provider` is finished. All of the story's tests now pass, and every suite the profile names is green. The report is in `tasks/pay-through-the-provider/build.md`.\n\n**What changed**\n- **Provider result:** it now says whether the provider authorized the payment, refused it, or was unavailable (`src/DcaShop.Checkout/Application/Shared/IPaymentProvider.cs`).\n- **Payment use case:** \"unavailable\" now raises `PaymentProviderUnavailableException`, and \"refused\" still raises `PaymentInitiationFailedException`. Neither changes the checkout session, and the provider is still called before the transaction.\n- **New `RestPaymentProvider`:**\n  - It sends one `POST payments` with amount and currency.\n  - `201` with a reference means authorized, and `402` means refused.\n  - The 2 s timeout, no connection, any other status, or a missing reference counts as unavailable.\n  - A request the customer cancels is passed on as a cancellation, not reported as unavailable.\n  - New settings `PaymentProviderOptions` under `Checkout:PaymentProvider`.\n- **Wiring:** the shop uses the REST provider when `Checkout:PaymentProvider:BaseUrl` is set, and the stand-in otherwise.\n- **Checkout page:** the controller shows the story's two texts for the two failures.\n- **Context map:** I updated the description of the payment provider on `CheckoutContext`, so the architecture test regenerated one line of `docs/architecture/context-map.md`.\n\n**Checks**\n- Build: 0 warnings, 0 errors.\n- Unit tests: 178 passed.\n- Integration tests: 65 passed, including all six provider payment tests.\n- Browser tests: 38 passed, including the new happy-path test, which I also ran on its own.\n- Architecture tests: 129 of 129 passed. The first run failed only because the context map had just been regenerated; the rerun was clean.\n- Formatter: clean.\n\n**Where I departed from the plan** (also recorded in `build.md`)\n- The provider result now carries an outcome enum instead of just gaining two extra factory methods, and the old `Failed` factory is gone.\n- The REST adapter creates a client from `IHttpClientFactory` for each call rather than holding one. The provider registry lives for the whole process, so a held client would never be renewed.\n\nThe profile names `dca-modelling` as the build carrier, but I didn't use it because the story changes no domain type. I applied `dca-discipline` to every file I wrote.","ttft_ms":2521,"type":"result","duration_ms":285595,"uuid":"80e7053a-5bfc-40b5-a29b-256715c00115","ttft_stream_ms":1631,"time_to_request_ms":60,"first_content_frame_ms":1631,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
